Monkeys leap out and fierce battle joins --- Makarākṣa routs monkeys with arrow masses --- Rāma checks Rākṣasas and accepts Makarākṣa duel challenge --- Makarākṣa recalls slain father Khara and boasts famished lion hunger --- Rāma recalls Daṇḍaka slaughter and cuts arrow showers --- Rāma cuts bow kills driver and smashes chariot horses --- Rāma cuts hurled blazing spear with three arrows --- Rāma fells fist rushing Makarākṣa with fire weapon as Rākṣasas flee